# The operator's half never goes in an image: `.env` is the secrets file and
# `.agentlings/` is this machine's ledger, levels and sandboxes. Both live on
# the volume at `/data` on a host, and a copy of the maintainer's baked into a
# published image is exactly the leak this line prevents.
.env
.agentlings/

# Rebuilt inside the image, and platform-specific: the tree resolved on
# Windows carries the wrong optional binaries for Linux.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
web/dist/

# History is not needed to run, and it is the largest thing here.
.git/
.github/

# Untracked inputs (`Artwork/`), rendered measurements and Blender sources —
# none of them are read at run time.
Artwork/
art/blender/
*.log
.claude/

# Windows and macOS leavings.
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
